    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 404,
       "endIndex": 573,
       "text": "Google\u2019s current offer does not sufficiently compensate you for that switch\u2014especially given the absence of a sign-on bonus and room left in their compensation bands"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1949,
       "endIndex": 2096,
       "text": "Google typically vests initial RSUs on a **front-loaded schedule** (usually **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%** or **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** vesting monthly)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       3,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2101,
       "endIndex": 2194,
       "text": "**Year 1 Equity:** ~$356,000 \u2013 $410,000 $\\rightarrow$ **Year 1 TC:** ~$638,000 \u2013 $692,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2197,
       "endIndex": 2290,
       "text": "**Year 2 Equity:** ~$345,000 \u2013 $356,000 $\\rightarrow$ **Year 2 TC:** ~$627,000 \u2013 $638,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2293,
       "endIndex": 2386,
       "text": "**Year 3 Equity:** ~$216,000 \u2013 $237,000 $\\rightarrow$ **Year 3 TC:** ~$498,000 \u2013 $519,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2389,
       "endIndex": 2482,
       "text": "**Year 4 Equity:** ~$108,000 \u2013 $129,000 $\\rightarrow$ **Year 4 TC:** ~$390,000 \u2013 $411,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2508,
       "endIndex": 2613,
       "text": "Your Year 1 compensation will look inflated, but by Years 3 and 4, your base grant drops by over 60\u201370%"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2617,
       "endIndex": 2782,
       "text": "While Google awards annual refreshers that vest evenly over 4 years (25% per year), as the recruiter noted, **refreshes are performance-dependent and discretionary**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2784,
       "endIndex": 2874,
       "text": "At Meta, your grants likely vest evenly at 25%/year with substantial refresher compounding"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3030,
       "endIndex": 3264,
       "text": "**Sign-on ($0):** It is standard for Google to omit a sign-on bonus in their opening offer, but they frequently use $50k\u2013$100k+ cash sign-ons to close candidates coming from Meta who leave behind unvested equity or impending bonuses"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3681,
       "endIndex": 3823,
       "text": "| **Equity (4-Yr)** | $1,080,000 | **$1,250,000 \u2013 $1,350,000** | Protects against the Year 3/4 drop-off and matches top-of-band L6 PM equity"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3827,
       "endIndex": 3964,
       "text": "| **Sign-on Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Offsets unvested Meta RSUs, bonus transition timing, and lateral switching friction"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4429,
       "endIndex": 4636,
       "text": "**Address the Year 3/4 cliff:** Acknowledge Google's front-loaded vesting and state that higher initial equity plus a sign-on bonus are necessary to make the 4-year expected value superior to staying at Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 5766,
       "endIndex": 5801,
       "text": "The compensation is top-tier for L6"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
